    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95261" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκυθ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <u>Scythian</u>, <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Ch.</u>
			161
		</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; of persons <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with a ruddy complexion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				48
			</span></i> B, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				336
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -κόν</span> the <i>Scythian
				race</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zos.
				4.20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				54
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κὸν ξύλον</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάψος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				167
			</span></i>:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκύθις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιδος</span>, acc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.172
			</span></i>: as name of a gem, <i><span class="en">
				Mart.Cap.
				1.75
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκυθικαί, αἱ</span>, <i>a kind of shoes</i>, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Περσικαί, Σικυώνια</span>
			, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				60S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκυθική</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίζα</span>), ἡ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυκύρριζα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.13.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					11.8.7
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				24
			</span></i>.</div>
